{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02250",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.16,
      "end_seconds": 4.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.54,
      "end_seconds": 9.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.86,
      "end_seconds": 22.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.6,
      "text": "It's breathlessness months after the infection. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.2,
      "end_seconds": 27.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.32,
      "end_seconds": 41.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.65,
      "end_seconds": 69.59,
      "duration_seconds": 9.94,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 117 over 68, temperature 36.5. And saturation 97 percent, pulse 68, respiratory rate 15. How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.33,
      "end_seconds": 80.98,
      "duration_seconds": 9.65,
      "text": "Hm. It was either the end of last month or earlier than that. I couldn't tell you the date."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.55,
      "end_seconds": 85.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.9,
      "end_seconds": 88.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Moderate, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.11,
      "end_seconds": 95.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "What about a racing heart on standing, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.3,
      "end_seconds": 99.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Right, yes, for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.42,
      "end_seconds": 106.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "What about brain fog, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.82,
      "end_seconds": 110.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Yeah. About four days, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.73,
      "end_seconds": 134.52,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chest pain, coughing up blood, leg swelling or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.38,
      "end_seconds": 143.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "Oh, no, no chest pain, coughing up blood, leg swelling or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.26,
      "end_seconds": 147.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Alright, how are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.67,
      "end_seconds": 152.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.39,
      "end_seconds": 173.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.92,
      "end_seconds": 188.82,
      "duration_seconds": 13.9,
      "text": "I, I have asthma, for five years. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.74,
      "end_seconds": 194.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Alright, asthma, that matches what I have here. Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.46,
      "end_seconds": 198.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.74,
      "end_seconds": 201.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.01,
      "end_seconds": 206.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.84,
      "end_seconds": 209.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.89,
      "end_seconds": 217.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.47,
      "end_seconds": 222.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.06,
      "end_seconds": 227.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.08,
      "end_seconds": 230.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.51,
      "end_seconds": 240.16,
      "duration_seconds": 8.65,
      "text": "Actually, just an operation for a hernia, last spring. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.42,
      "end_seconds": 250.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.75,
      "end_seconds": 259.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Well, uh, no allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.61,
      "end_seconds": 264.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.4,
      "end_seconds": 269.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "I take Asthalin inhaler, when needed for my asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.51,
      "end_seconds": 276.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.57,
      "end_seconds": 280.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Right, does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.05,
      "end_seconds": 298.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.76,
      "text": "Your oxygen is normal at rest and after walking and your chest is clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.63,
      "end_seconds": 313.32,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Let me tell you where I've got to. My working impression is post-viral symptoms after COVID."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.18,
      "end_seconds": 322.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Well, you know, will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.7,
      "end_seconds": 357.67,
      "duration_seconds": 33.97,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now post-viral symptoms after COVID is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's book a chest X-ray to look into persistent breathlessness. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Pace your activity and increase it slowly each week. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Let's plan a check in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.71,
      "end_seconds": 363.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.49,
      "end_seconds": 370.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "So, I come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.35,
      "end_seconds": 376.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.39,
      "end_seconds": 380.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}